OL,3,GNEWSAPalestinian flags recovered from
OL,4,Aindustrial site break-in, police say
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree women were arrested on suspicion
OL,7,Fof aggravated burglary after
OL,8,F"significant damage" was caused at an
OL,9,Findustrial estate, police said.
OL,11,FHertfordshire Police was called at
OL,12,F03:44 GMT to Icknield Way Industrial
OL,13,FEstate, Tring.
OL,15,FIt said a 23-year-old from Bristol, a
OL,16,F26-year-old from Newcastle upon Tyne
OL,17,Fand a 27-year-old from Middlesbrough
OL,18,Fwere all apprehended.
